invalid type: string "# Pipeline Recovery Runbook\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis runbook describes the general procedure for investigating and\nrecovering from a failed pipeline batch.\n\n## Step 1 - Identify the Failure\n\nIdentify:\n\n- DAG\n- Run ID\n- Failed task\n- Batch ID\n- Failure timestamp\n- Error message\n\n## Step 2 - Inspect Logs\n\ne:\n\n- Acknowledge the failure within 15 minutes.\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ